        "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064550/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1761338376\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>A Roguelike coin-flipper where your choices have a BIG impact. One wrong choice and you're bound to fail. Flip coins, upgrade them, flip them again, SCORE BIG!!<br><br>Whether your build is based in luck, rapid coin flipping action or setting up the last turn for a massive point explosion, there's always a new way to play.<br><br>With a crafted soundtrack and a unique pixel art style, you're bound to find yourself playing this game way past your bedtime. You're always one run away from a new high score.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064550/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1761338376\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 original crafted music tracks<br></li><li>A fun retro art style<br></li><li>30+ unique coin augments<br></li><li>100+ casual hours of fun</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064550/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1761338376\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
